usage: ucdcases [--every n] [--whatwg dir] <ucd-dir> <cases-dir>
Options:
  --every <int>   Keep every n-th line of NormalizationTest's part 1, the per-character part (default 16)
  --whatwg <str>  A directory holding the Encoding Standard's encodings.json and index-*.txt files
Arguments:
  <dirs>...       The UCD directory (holding NormalizationTest.txt and auxiliary/), then the cases directory
